# Everything listed here is deliberately kept out of the source tree so it can never be swept in by `chezmoi add` / `chezmoi re-add`.

# gcloud-generated SSH host inventory.
# `just gcloud-config-ssh` runs `gcloud compute config-ssh --ssh-config-file ~/.ssh/config.d/<profile>`, which writes GCE instance names, project IDs and raw IP addresses into this directory.
# Allowlist only the hand-written fragments; ignore everything else.
.ssh/config.d/*
!.ssh/config.d/cwyu57

# macOS noise that has no business in a dotfiles repo.
.ssh/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
